<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.B. Hunt cut to sell.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.B. Hunt cut to sell.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gruntal and Co said analyst Steve Lewins downgraded J.B. Hunt Transport Services Inc to sell from hold.</p>
<p>-- cut 1997 estimate to $0.35 from $0.50.</p>
<p>-- cited disappointing second quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 2/16 to 15-3/16.</p>
</text>
